 "description": "Return the latest published NHS waiting-time figures for the Integrated Care Board covering a UK postcode, or for a named board: the median wait, how many people are waiting, the wait bands, and how that compares with the national average. Figures are NHS England's own published statistics, with the reporting period stated. Useful context when someone is deciding whether to wait or to go private; pair it with search_clinics for what is bookable privately nearby.",
 "inputSchema": {
  "properties": {
   "icb": {
    "description": "Alternative to postcode: an Integrated Care Board by name, slug or code, e.g. \"Greater Manchester\".",
    "type": "string"
   },
   "postcode": {
    "description": "A UK postcode. The Integrated Care Board covering it is looked up locally, with no external call.",
    "type": "string"
   },
   "specialty": {
    "description": "Optional. Defaults to MSK physiotherapy, the waiting list private physiotherapy is an alternative to.",
    "type": "string"
   }
  },
  "type": "object"
 },
 "name": "get_nhs_wait",
